      "writtenOn": "2025-05-29T17:30:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Which spec are you referring to SMCCC or FF-A? FF-A \u003c\u003d1.1 mandates that x8 and above are preserved in all cases. FF-A 1.2/1.3 mandates that x8 and above is preserved for 32 bit opcodes. Clearing x3-x17 unconditionally, is not compliant and can crash a compliant guest (it _will_ crash a 32 bit client if 32 bit clients are ever supported)",
